{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52858","headline":"梅诗 · 王昌龄","name":"梅诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落落寞寞路不分，梦中唤作梨花云。\n（见《苕溪渔隐丛话前集》卷四、《野客丛书》卷六引曾慥《高斋诗话》、龙榆生《东坡乐府笺》卷二《西江月》注引南宋傅藻注引。\n）（按：《墨庄漫录》卷六载此诗全篇，以爲王建作，详本书卷十八。\n然曾慥时代较早，当有所据。\n苏轼《西江月》词末句云：「不与梨花同梦。\n」自跋云：「诗人王昌龄梦中作梅花诗。\n」傅注因引此二句。\n其时代较曾慥更早。\n今互收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}